            "@id": "concentrateFeedBlend",
            "units": "kg"
          },
          "isAnimalFeed": true,
          "value": [
            1737.2897260273971
          ],
          "methodClassification": "estimated with assumptions",
          "methodClassificationDescription": "For the lamb feeds (forage, straw and concentrate), we have assumed that the total annual intake values provided in the study are equal to what a lamb would consume if alive for a full year i.e. these values do not take into account that slaughter and mortality cut their lifespan shorter (these are taken into account in the average number of lambs, and therefore will be incorporated into total feed intake for all lambs).",
